---
/* The rate limiter, drawn and playable in one panel: clients take a ticket, it passes authentication at the API
   Gateway, and the rate limiter (which holds the token bucket) either lets it through to a service or sends a 429
   back. The service names are generic, not product names. Tickets travel the diagram via limiter.js. */
---
<div class="dispenser" id="dispenser">
  <figure class="arch">
    <div class="arch-map">
      <div class="arch-clients">
        <span class="arch-node">Clients</span>
        <button class="btn" type="button" id="take" disabled>Take a ticket</button>
      </div>
      <span class="arch-lane arch-in" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="arch-gateway">
        <span class="arch-label">API Gateway</span>
        <div class="arch-gate">
          <span class="arch-node">Authentication</span>
          <span class="arch-lane" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div class="arch-node hot">Rate limiter
            <div class="bucket" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="chip"></span><span class="chip"></span><span class="chip"></span><span class="chip"></span><span class="chip"></span>
            </div>
            <p class="bucket-label" id="bucket-label">5 of 5 tokens left</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="arch-lane arch-go" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="arch-services">
        <span class="arch-label">Behind the gateway</span>
        <span class="arch-node">Webhook delivery services</span>
        <span class="arch-node">Backend services</span>
      </div>
      <div class="arch-parcels" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="arch-back"><span class="arch-lane arch-return" aria-hidden="true"></span>429 Too Many Requests: over the limit, answered at the gateway</p>
    <figcaption>Every request passes authentication at the API Gateway, then the rate limiter decides. Within the limit, the request goes on to the service. Over the limit, the gateway answers 429 Too Many Requests and the service never sees it.</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <ol class="tickets" id="tickets" aria-live="polite"></ol>
  <p class="fallback" id="fallback">This demo needs JavaScript. It lets you take five tickets, then answers 429 Too Many Requests until a new token arrives.</p>
</div>
<script>
  import '../../scripts/limiter.js';
</script>
